  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At first I though the new chatbox notification sound wasn't event working. But then I listened very carefully when no one else was talking and I could just barely make out a subtle \"pop\" sound.\nThe volume slider is at 100% and it's still barely audible over normal speech.\nCombined with the option for the sound defaulting off, this makes the feature almost totally useless.\nI ask that you please treat the chatbox system more seriously. It's not just some gimmick, for some people it is as important as audible speech!",
